From c4eda0343e9a0643c2753c7be39ec05579964dad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:37:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/31] [PD] decode: Release deferred KV and skip transfer
 polling in unison across attn-TP ranks

Deferred releases freed device pages on a rank-local ack or deadline, so
attn-TP ranks admitted different prealloc requests after client cancels and
hung in different collectives. MIN-reduce the ready flag for every deferred
entry, and make pop_transferred's empty-queue skip a group decision that
fails loudly if the queues have already diverged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
